OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh public sector unlikely to
OL,4,Ameet net zero plans by 2030, say
OL,5,Aauditors
OL,6,
OL,7,FA spending watchdog has strongly
OL,8,Fcriticised the lack of progress made by
OL,9,Fpublic sector organisations in tackling
OL,10,Fclimate change.
OL,12,FAudit Wales says since a Welsh
OL,13,Fgovernment "climate emergency" was
OL,14,Fdeclared in 2019, "decarbonisation" has
OL,15,Fbecome a lower priority for public
OL,16,Fbodies.
OL,18,FIt says there are many examples of
OL,19,Fpositive changes but the "collective
OL,20,Fambition" for a net zero public sector
OL,21,Fin Wales by 2030 is unlikely to be met.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
