OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh public sector unlikely to
OL,4,Ameet net zero plans by 2030, say
OL,5,Aauditors
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt has been estimated that it would
OL,8,Fcost at least #2.3bn to decarbonise
OL,9,FWelsh council buildings alone.
